  "description": "Da-Na is a freelance illustrator who feels lonely and stressed out from working all day and doing little else. But this all changes when she is joined by a new four-legged friend: a small pomeranian puppy called Myeong-Dong. This cute little pup shows her what unconditional love looks like, and Da-Na does her best to look after her new pal, too. \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS, edited)",
